{
  "_note": [
    "Input to tools/build-vocab.mjs. NOT shipped content: the shipped content is",
    "data/vocab/*.json, which this file selects out of jmdict-eng-common.",
    "Each word is a lookup, not a translation. `q` matches a kanji or kana form",
    "exactly; `pos` disambiguates when a form has several entries (は is a",
    "particle and also a tooth); `reading` picks one kana form when JMdict lists",
    "several and the first is not the one a beginner should learn (four is よん,",
    "not し, in a counting drill). `senses` caps how many glosses are kept.",
    "A word that resolves to nothing is reported by name and the run fails, so a",
    "typo here can never become a silently shorter deck."
  ],
